# Opportunex engine — optional environment overrides (all prefixed OPX_).
# Nothing here is required: by default data lives in %APPDATA%\PIO (Windows)
# or ~/.local/share/pio (Linux). Never put secrets in this file: AI keys are
# stored in the OS keychain from the Settings screen.

# OPX_DATA_DIR=D:\opportunex-dev-data
# OPX_LOG_LEVEL=INFO
# OPX_SQL_ECHO=false
# OPX_SESSION_TTL_HOURS=12
